  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MOSAIKO Justice, Resilience, and Environment in Eastern Angola</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NGOs, religious institutions, youth groups and social activists can influence public policies, increase civic spaces and contribute to better governance. This project promotes human rights, citizen participation and accountability in Eastern Angola through media and communication, research and publications, and community human rights groups linked to the Catholic church.</narrative>
  </description>
